description=Let Bluetooth A2DP (LDAC/hardware offload) media use a deep-buffer mixer at the track sample rate (44.1/48/88.2/96 kHz) instead of the fixed 48 kHz. Overlays audio_module_config_primary.xml (sku_canoe).
